          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Proshort AI Sales Coaching Platform Crosses $1M ARR Within a Year of Launch",
            "articleSection": "How to Evolve",
            "abstract": "Indian AI startup Proshort, founded by Gaurav Mishra, has reached $1 million in annual recurring revenue within its first year by offering real-time AI sales coaching that delivers live insights to sales professionals during customer interactions. The platform targets India's large and growing sales workforce, providing on-the-job AI assistance without requiring formal training programmes. Crossing $1M ARR in year one positions Proshort among the faster-growing B2B AI SaaS companies to emerge from India in 2025–26.",
